    "scopes_file": "docs/developer-harness-v2/bypass-scopes.json",
    "added_actions": ["run_privileged_infrastructure"],
    "rule": "Additive classification (run_privileged_infrastructure is human_approval, the class of the run_unreviewed_script finding it refines). No action class in this contract changed; the transition changes only how bypassPermissions resolves non-forbidden findings."
